/Title (Deployment began in 2017 with Franco-German project teams and workshops with technicians every fortnight. Existing data was mass-imported rather than re-keyed. The desktop system was paired with a mobile application so technicians could reach technical specifications and breakdown history on their phones and file reports in a few clicks.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
