2322 0 obj
<<
/Title (More than 200 people now use the system daily. Inventory covers over 10,000 items. The preventive maintenance rate stands at 30 per cent, and performance indicators the group designed itself are used to analyse all 12,000 annual service calls. The rollout has continued into Australia and the United States.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2312 0 R
>>
